  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6102.07 Proctor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6102.07 “Proctor” means an individual who has been approved by the commissioner to offer boating safety education courses and to administer an equivalency examination.\n\nSource. #7650, eff 2-20-02; ss by #9472, eff 5-18-09; ss by #12467, eff 1-25-18",
